      "volume_candidate": 16,
      "volume_part": "",
      "volume_verified": false,
      "structural_volume_verified": true,
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "冬十月癸未，賊陷長山，典史李暹戰死。甲申，賊焚糧艘於濟寧州。丁酉，甘州副總兵白琮敗小王子於柴溝[3]。",
      "boundary_basis": "epub_source_paragraph",
